{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_014k93RTUpnnzYvzVA17W3xv","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01QXsHCyQLBuhMPwMSeiApGV","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/workspace/KEY_DECISIONS.md","content":"# KEY_DECISIONS.md\n\nImplementation decisions, deviations, and deliberate limitations.\n\n---\n\n## E1 — SpellCastTriggeredEvent fired in cast_spell (engine/casting.py)\n- Fired after `game.stack.push(stack_obj)` so `stack_obj` is on the stack when triggers see it.\n- `cast_spell_free` also fires the event (used by Silverquill casualty, Great Hall pump, etc.).\n\n## E2 — BeginningOfPrecombatMainTriggeredEvent (engine/events.py + engine/game_state.py)\n- Fieldless event modeled on BeginningOfUpkeepTriggeredEvent.\n- Fired from advance_phase after empty_mana_pools() so handler-added mana survives.\n- Handlers identify \"your\" main phase by checking game.active_player.\n\n## E3 — Battlefield cost reduction aggregation (engine/casting.py)\n- Only applied to instants/sorceries (per sos_245 spec).\n- Checks permanents on the caster's battlefield for spell_cost_reduction(game, card) -> int.\n- Clamped at 0 like the existing self-reduction.\n\n## sos_1 — The Dawning Archaic — Replacement effect scope\n- The exile-instead replacement registers when cast via the on_cast hook with a turn stamp,\n  then unregisters once the spell resolves or the turn changes. This is card-local.\n\n## sos_13 — Emeritus of Truce // Swords to Plowshares — Prepared state\n- `is_prepared` flag on the creature; cast-from-exile via cast_spell_free.\n- The spell copy is an actual SwordsToPlowshares instance put in exile, then cast from there.\n\n## sos_57 — Mana Sculpt — One-shot trigger\n- Trigger on BeginningOfPrecombatMainTriggeredEvent stamped with the cast turn number.\n- Fires only for the active player who cast Mana Sculpt (controller check).\n\n## sos_97 — Ral Zarek — game.rng\n- Added game.rng = random.Random() lazily; tests seed it for determinism.\n\n## sos_97 — skip_turns gap\n- skip_turns attribute on Player; decremented in advance_phase when BEGINNING phase starts.\n- Deliberate limitation: only handles \"skip next N normal turns\"; does not interact with extra-turns queue.\n\n## sos_201 — Miracle miracle cost\n- Miracle fires on DrawsCardTriggeredEvent, gated to first draw this turn.\n- Tracks first draw with player.cards_drawn_this_turn == 1 (already tracked by draw_card).\n- Miracle cost = {2} deducted from effective cost using _apply_cost_reduction logic.\n\n## sos_257 — Restricted mana\n- Added `_restriction` optional attribute to mana in the pool via ManaPool.add_restricted.\n- Only instant/sorcery checks are enforced. Deliberate limitation: one restriction tag per pool add.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4284,"cache_read_input_tokens":82053,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4284},"output_tokens":24,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2e9c65f7-ddbe-4353-b4d6-7512c729a9ad","uuid":"edca49c6-0681-4c8c-9e02-31061b54a933","request_id":"req_011CbwFXizmYS3ReTyDXpWH4"}
