n BeginningOfPrecombatMainTriggeredEvent stamped with the cast turn number.\n- Fires only for the active player who cast Mana Sculpt (controller check).\n\n## sos_97 — Ral Zarek — game.rng\n- Added game.rng = random.Random() lazily; tests seed it for determinism.\n\n## sos_97 — skip_turns gap\n- skip_turns attribute on Player; decremented in advance_phase when BEGINNING phase starts.\n- Deliberate limitation: only handles \"skip next N normal turns\"; does not interact with extra-turns queue.\n\n## sos_201 — Miracle miracle cost\n- Miracle fires on DrawsCardTriggeredEvent, gated to first draw this turn.\n- Tracks first draw with player.cards_drawn_this_turn == 1 (already tracked by draw_card).\n- Miracle cost = {2} deducted from effective cost using _apply_cost_reduction logic.\n\n## sos_257 — Restricted mana\n- Added `_restriction` optional attribute to mana in the pool via ManaPool.add_restricted.\n- Only instant/sorcery checks are enforced. Deliberate limitation: one restriction tag per pool add.\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false}}
